      "text": "Catch Combo: [VAR NUM3(0000)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "id": "poke_get_40_01",
      "hash": "f3d3d054a2eb0b0a",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "OAK: My, my... I surely wouldn’t have expected\\n[VAR INDEF_ART(0000)][VAR POKNAME(0000)] to appear around here!\\c\\nBut since the opportunity has presented itself...\\nwhy don’t we practice some [VAR COLOR(0006)]Pokémon catching[VAR COLOR(0000)]?\\c\\nYou just have to throw out your [VAR COLOR(0006)]Poké Ball [VAR COLOR(0000)]and try\\nto land it on a wild Pokémon for the chance\\r\\nto catch it!"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "id": "poke_get_40_02",
      "hash": "f3d3cf54a2eb0957",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "OAK: It can be a bit trickier than it sounds,\\nwouldn’t you say?\\c\\nI’ll give you some more Poké Balls, so give it\\nanother go!"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "id": "poke_get_50_01",
      "hash": "67046c5e742075ed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hold your Joy-Con horizontally, and point it\\nstraight at the screen."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "id": "poke_get_50_02",
      "hash": "6704695e742070d4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "With your Joy-Con pointing at the screen,\\npress the A Button to ready a Poké Ball!"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "id": "poke_get_50_03",
      "hash": "67046a5e74207287",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You can throw your Poké Ball by waving\\nyour Joy-Con!"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "id": "poke_get_50_04",
      "hash": "6704675e74206d6e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Keep an eye on the rings as you throw your Poké\\nBall. And watch out—some Pokémon move!"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "id": "poke_get_50_05",
      "hash": "6704685e74206f21",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Just don’t forget your surroundings as you go\\nwaving that Joy-Con around the place!"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "id": "poke_get_60_01",
      "hash": "d78b089360342284",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hold your system firmly with both hands, and\\npress the A Button to ready a Poké Ball."
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "id": "poke_get_60_02",
      "hash": "d78b0b936034279d",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Once you’ve readied a Poké Ball, you can move\\nyour system to look around the area."
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "id": "poke_get_60_03",
      "hash": "d78b0a93603425ea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Press the A Button again to throw a Poké Ball!\\nIt will be thrown toward the center of the screen."
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "id": "poke_get_60_04",
      "hash": "d78b059360341d6b",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Aim your ball so it’ll hit within the two rings,\\nand watch out, because some Pokémon move!"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "id": "poke_get_60_05",
      "hash": "d78b049360341bb8",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "If you have a hard time seeing things or moving\\nyour system, press the B Button to reset the view."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "id": "poke_get_70_01",
      "hash": "1d1727bc4a7b69a7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You’ve changed your controller input!\\nLet’s start over from the beginning."
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "id": "poke_get_80_01",
      "hash": "b4ecb8880ddd1d76",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You’ve changed your play mode.\\nWould you like to go through the tutorial again?"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "id": "poke_get_80_02",
      "hash": "b4ecb7880ddd1bc3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Would you like to go through the tutorial again\\nto review how to throw Poké Balls?"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "id": "poke_get_80_03",
      "hash": "b4ecb6880ddd1a10",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Choose a Berry from your Bag to use it!"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "id": "poke_get_80_04",
      "hash": "b4ecbd880ddd25f5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Get your Poké Ball through the moving ring,\\nand you can get a bonus for great technique!"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "id": "poke_get_80_05",
      "hash": "b4ecbc880ddd2442",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "As the ring gets smaller, that’s your chance to\\ntry to snag a great bonus!"
    }
  ],
